{
  "Npcs.ImpGang.Desc": "The imps stand anywhere from [if (metric) {half a meter to a little over a meter|two to four feet}] tall, with scrawny builds and tiny demonic wings. Their red and orange skin is dirty, and their dark hair looks greasy. Some are naked, but most are dressed in ragged loincloths that do little to hide their groins. They all have a {0} as long and thick as a man's arm, far oversized for their bodies."
  "Npcs.ImpGang.Name": "mob of imps"
}
